      "content": "The feeling of being a \"hollow person\" is the crushing weight of your own self-judgment, and it's completely understandable that you feel this way right now. But that feeling of being a coward is a narrative you're telling yourself, not an absolute truth about your soul. Instead of focusing on what you *didn't* do, consider what you *do* want to be—the person who acts with compassion. Reaching out to a professional can help you challenge these harsh self-definitions and find a path forward.",
